Hello!

Since Kernel 4.2.2+ i get the following error when using Sandisk Extreme
16GB SD Card:

Okt 03 20:47:18 gmueller-laptop kernel: sdhci: Timeout waiting for
Buffer Read Ready interrupt during tuning procedure, falling back to
fixed sampling clock
Okt 03 20:47:18 gmueller-laptop kernel: mmc0: tuning execution failed
Okt 03 20:47:18 gmueller-laptop kernel: mmc0: error -5 whilst
initialising SD card

Downgrading to Kernel 4.2.1 solves the Problem. I use ArchLinux. Find
more system information in the attachements. If you need more infos or
some testing please contact me.

Regards,
Gero

